+**Algorithm Steps**
+
+1.  **Splat Depositing**:
     For each Gaussian primitive $G_k$ with mean $\mu_k$:
-    a. Identify the set $\{M_k\}$ of nearest voxels (typically the 8 adjacent voxels) [S1].
